[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9180.63, "timestamp": "02:33:00", "text": "迅速将安全变为不安全。在那里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9182.23, "timestamp": "02:33:02", "text": "去。好的。其中一人失败了。之一"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9183.91, "timestamp": "02:33:03", "text": "他们成功了。点击造成伤害。哦，等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9185.429, "timestamp": "02:33:05", "text": "是的。坚持，稍等。哦，是的。患病的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9187.349, "timestamp": "02:33:07", "text": "我就做你之前做的那九个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9190.15, "timestamp": "02:33:10", "text": "这是你做的。私人的。所以它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9192.15, "timestamp": "02:33:12", "text": "所以，这是个九。所以事情就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9194.63, "timestamp": "02:33:14", "text": "受到九点伤害。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9196.389, "timestamp": "02:33:16", "text": "九。然后，其中一个将是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9198.71, "timestamp": "02:33:18", "text": "哦，原来还有东西可以拿啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9199.99, "timestamp": "02:33:19", "text": "第四步。好的。好了。全部"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9203.51, "timestamp": "02:33:23", "text": "正确的。还要别的吗？那是你的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9205.349, "timestamp": "02:33:25", "text": "部分。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9207.87, "timestamp": "02:33:27", "text": "呃，行动。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9210.309, "timestamp": "02:33:30", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9212.71, "timestamp": "02:33:32", "text": "这很难。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9215.67, "timestamp": "02:33:35", "text": "嗯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9217.91, "timestamp": "02:33:37", "text": "等等，我好像用掉了一个名额。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9219.19, "timestamp": "02:33:39", "text": "没错，这是第二层。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9222.15, "timestamp": "02:33:42", "text": "哦，不。你不用它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9223.83, "timestamp": "02:33:43", "text": "之前但再次使用月光"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9225.75, "timestamp": "02:33:45", "text": "因为它仍然在为他们投票。你没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9227.51, "timestamp": "02:33:47", "text": "使用另一个法术位。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9228.469, "timestamp": "02:33:48", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9230.95, "timestamp": "02:33:50", "text": "目前为止，你只使用过一个法术。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9233.99, "timestamp": "02:33:53", "text": "月光光束插槽。就这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9239.03, "timestamp": "02:33:59", "text": "好的。那我就会用魔法石了。"}]